---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { getUrl } from "../lib/helpers";
---

<Layout
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Home", href: "/" }, { label: "Legal Notice" }]}
  backHref="/"
>
  <section class="mx-auto my-16 px-4 max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">Legal Notice</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-2"><strong>SUM Open Data Platform (ODP)</strong></p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mb-8"><em>Last updated: 1 June 2026</em></p>

    <p class="mb-8">
      This Legal Notice applies to the SUM Open Data Platform (the "Platform"), accessible at{" "}
      <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href="https://sum-odp.eu">https://sum-odp.eu</a>{" "}
      and{" "}
      <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href="https://odp.sum-project.eu">https://odp.sum-project.eu</a>.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 1 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">1. Publisher</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The Platform is published as part of the <strong>SUM (Seamless Shared Urban Mobility)</strong>{" "}
      project by the <strong>SUM Consortium</strong>, the group of partner organisations
      participating in the project.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The project has received funding from the European Union's Horizon Europe Research and
      Innovation programme under <strong>Grant Agreement No&nbsp;101103646</strong>.
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
      <li>
        <strong>Project coordinator / point of contact:</strong> INRIA (Institut National de
        Recherche en Informatique et en Automatique)
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Registered office of the coordinator:</strong> Parc scientifique de la
        Haute-Borne, 40 avenue Halley – Bât A – Park Plaza, 59650 Villeneuve d'Ascq, France
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact:</strong>{" "}
        <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href="mailto:odp@sum-project.eu">odp@sum-project.eu</a>
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Project website:</strong>{" "}
        <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href="https://www.sum-project.eu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          https://www.sum-project.eu
        </a>
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <strong>Director of publication:</strong>{" "}
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">The Platform is developed by SUM Consortium partners:</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
      <li>
        the public website and Living Lab features are developed by <strong>INRIA</strong>;
      </li>
      <li>
        the administration features are developed {" "}
        <strong>UTwente (University of Twente)</strong>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 2 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">2. Hosting</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">The Platform is hosted on <strong>INRIA servers</strong>.</p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4 space-y-1 text-gray-700">
      <li><strong>Host:</strong> INRIA (Institut National de Recherche en Informatique et en Automatique)</li>
      <li>
        <strong>Address / data centre:</strong> Parc scientifique de la Haute-Borne,
        40 avenue Halley – Bât A – Park Plaza, 59650 Villeneuve d'Ascq, France
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Contact:</strong>{" "}
        <mark class="bg-yellow-100 text-yellow-800 px-1 rounded"></mark>
      </li>
    </ul>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 3 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">3. Intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Unless otherwise stated, the content of the Platform, including its structure, texts,
      graphics, logos, and software, is the property of the <strong>SUM Consortium</strong> and
      its partners, or is used with the authorisation of the rights holders. It is protected by
      applicable intellectual property law.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4 text-gray-600 text-sm">Copyright © SUM Consortium.</p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      <strong>Open data and open-source content.</strong> Datasets and research outputs published
      openly through the Platform are made available under the applicable open licences defined by
      the project (for example, Creative Commons licences for publications and the licences
      specified for each dataset). Please refer to the licence indicated for each dataset or
      publication before reuse. The applicable terms follow the SUM Data Management Plan and the
      principle "as open as possible, as closed as necessary".
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Any reproduction, representation, modification or distribution of protected content, in whole
      or in part, without prior authorisation or outside the terms of the applicable licence, is
      prohibited.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 4 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">4. Personal data and cookies</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The processing of personal data through the Platform is described in the{" "}
      <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href={getUrl("/privacy-policy")}>Privacy Policy</a>.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The Platform uses only strictly necessary cookies required for its operation and to maintain
      user login sessions. It does not use advertising or third-party tracking cookies. See the
      Privacy Policy for details.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      For any question regarding personal data, or to exercise your rights under the GDPR,
      contact{" "}
      <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href="mailto:odp@sum-project.eu">odp@sum-project.eu</a>{" "}
      or the INRIA Data Protection Officer at{" "}
      <a class="text-secondary hover:underline" href="mailto:dpo@inria.fr">dpo@inria.fr</a>.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 5 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">5. Liability</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The Platform and its content are provided for information purposes. The SUM Consortium
      endeavours to keep the information published on the Platform accurate and up to date, but
      cannot guarantee that it is complete, accurate or error-free. Use of the information made
      available on the Platform is under the sole responsibility of the user.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The SUM Consortium cannot be held liable for any direct or indirect damage resulting from
      access to or use of the Platform, including the unavailability of the service, or from the
      use of any information obtained through it.
    </p>
    <p class="mb-4">
      The Platform may contain links to external websites that are not under the control of the
      SUM Consortium. The SUM Consortium is not responsible for the content or privacy practices
      of these external sites.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 6 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">6. EU funding disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      Co-funded by the European Union. Views and opinions expressed are however those of the
      author(s) only and do not necessarily reflect those of the European Union or the European
      Climate, Infrastructure and Environment Executive Agency (CINEA). Neither the European Union
      nor the granting authority can be held responsible for them.
    </p>

    <hr class="border-gray-200 my-8" />

    {/* Section 7 */}
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mt-10 mb-4">7. Applicable law</h2>
    <p class="mb-4">
      This Legal Notice is governed by <strong>French law</strong>, as the coordinating partner
      (INRIA) is established in France, without prejudice to mandatory provisions of European Union
      law, in particular the GDPR.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
